+// Normalize per-capita price for display on shop cards. Tolerates:
+//   - numbers (e.g. 48)                         → "人均 48元"
+//   - "48"                                      → "人均 48元"
+//   - "48元" / "48 元/人" / "48 yuan/person"      → "人均 48元"
+//   - "人均 48元" (already formatted)             → "人均 48元" (no double prefix)
